  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN271.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">pirivuṇarttiya tōḻi talaimakaḷatu kuṟippaṟintu vanta talaimakaṉaic celavaḻuṅkac colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante, who [was] informed about the separation, said in order to prevent him from going who had come after understanding HER intentions.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN271.1">
        <l>poṟivarip puṟaviṉ ceṅkāṟ cēval</l>
        <l>ciṟupuṉ peṭaiyoṭu cēṭpulam pōki</l>
        <l>yarimaṇa liyaviṟ paraṟērn tu<supplied>ṇṭu</supplied></l>
        <l><supplied>va</supplied>rimaral vāṭiya vāṉīṅku naṉantalaik</l>
        <l>kuṟumpoṟai maruṅkiṟ kōṭcura nīnti</l>
        <l>neṭuñcēṇ vanta nirainacai vampalar</l>
        <l>celluyir niṟutta cuvaikkāy nellip</l>
        <l>palkā yañciṉai yakavu mattañ</l>
        <l>ceṉṟunīr vaṇika rāki niṉṟutaru</l>
        <l>nilaiyarum poruṭpiṇi niṉaintaṉi reṉiṉē</l>
        <l>valva tākanuñ ceyviṉai yivaṭkē</l>
        <l>kaḷimali kaḷḷi ṉaṟṟē raviya</l>
        <l>ṉāṭiya liḷamaḻai cūṭit tōṉṟum</l>
        <l>paḻantūṅku viṭarakat teḻunta kāmpiṉ</l>
        <l>kaṇṇiṭai puraiyu neṭumeṉ paṇaittōṭ</l>
        <l>ṭiruntukō lāytoṭi ñekiḻiṉ</l>
        <l>maruntu muṇṭō pirintuṟai nāṭē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l>If, enticed by wealth difficult to keep, that has to be brought</l>
        <l corresp="9f">constantly, you think of going as a trader</l>
        <l corresp="8d">on the road, where</l>
        <l corresp="1">the red-legged male of the dove with dots and lines</l>
        <l corresp="2">goes to distant regions with [its] little tawny female,</l>
        <l corresp="3">searches the pebbles on the way with soft sand, eats,</l>
        <l corresp="8a-c" rend="indent3">[and] calls out on the pretty branches with many unripe fruit</l>
        <l corresp="7">of the gooseberry with tasty fruits planted [to preserve] the waning life</l>
        <l corresp="6">of travellers desirous of herds who come from a long distance,</l>
        <l corresp="5">crossing the murderous desert by the side of short hillocks</l>
        <l corresp="4">in the vast area left by the clouds, where the striped bow-string hemp is faded,</l>
        <l corresp="11">let it be fast, your work to be done. As for her,</l>
        <l corresp="16">if [her] perfect, beautiful, choice bangles become loose</l>
        <l corresp="15">on [her] large soft bamboo arms that resemble the middle of the joints</l>
        <l corresp="14">in a bamboo shaft that rises inside a cleft hung with fruits</l>
        <l corresp="13">that appear wearing the young rain [clouds], whose nature is moving,</l>
        <l corresp="12">of Aviyaṉ with a good chariot [and] plenty of intoxicating licquor,</l>
        <l corresp="16">will there be a remedy too, in the land where you stay after parting [from her]?</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
